pufferl: r40 shared scalar recurrent value head
pufferl: zone critic on (90 slot returns, valves use the zone advantage alone)
pufferl: Adam on (Kingma, beta1 0.9, beta2 0.999, eps 1e-8, bias correction, weight decay 0)
pufferl: advantage normalization on (mean/var over the whole rollout)
pufferl: learning-reward clamp off (train.rew_clamp = 0.000)
pufferl: zone MLP on (32 tanh units on context and zone features, zero-output affine skip)
pufferl: Beta policy on the continuous heads (alpha, beta = softplus + 0.5; env action 2x-1; deterministic = mean; logstd unused)
pufferl: Beta concentration capped at alpha+beta 12 (mean preserved; a non-decaying exploration term, r94)
pufferl: headwise Beta marginal PPO ratio on; loss/kl and clipfrac remain geometric aggregate
smart_buildings: zone critic on (per-zone return, fuel split by occupancy)
smart_buildings: zone memory on (anticipation from the observation)
smart_buildings: canonical layout (983 obs, 219 continuous heads), absolute actions
