SB_HEAD_COLUMNS epoch group role n sum_abs_logratio sum_logratio outside sign_clipped sign_clipped_geom_inside nonfinite sum_ratio sum_abs_geom_logratio; SB_HEAD_FIRST is each agent's first minibatch visit
smart_buildings: scenario/time/occupancy detail metrics on
SB_ZONE_MLP columns: epoch, first-layer weight norm, last raw gradient norm, second-layer weight norm, last raw gradient norm
SB_ROLESTEP columns: epoch, then per role zone AHU plant: sum_visits ||g|| (pre-clip), sum_visits ||dW|| (applied), ||W_end - W_start|| (net over the epoch); then visits
SB_VALVE_CREDIT on: per damper/reheat: n sum_building sum_zone sum_building2 sum_zone2 sum_cross sum_building_dx sum_zone_dx sum_mean sum_mean2 sum_action sum_action2 opposite_sign_count
SB_CREDIT on: 960 agents, 32 per group; columns per type (sat sp recirc run water pump damper reheat): sum_A_dx sum_dx2 sum_A2 n
SB_ZONE_STATS: first replay visit, one row/hour, empty observation -0; time=night/scheduled_morning/scheduled_afternoon/scheduled_evening/unscheduled_day, occupancy=observed_empty/observed_nonempty (previous interval), state=cold/band/hot/overlap; actions are [0,1] Beta draws and means
SB_ZONE_ACTION_COLUMNS epoch group time occupancy state head n sum_mu sum_mu2 sum_draw sum_draw2 mu_low mu_high draw_low draw_high transition_n sum_abs_delta sum_delta2
SB_ZONE_VALUE_COLUMNS epoch group time occupancy state n sum_pred sum_gae_target sum_target2 sum_residual sum_residual2
SB_ZONE_SPREAD_COLUMNS epoch group time occupancy head n sum_same_time_zone_sd sum_sd2
